  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Relief to Victims of Floods</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HDO will provide blankets, mosquito nets and solar lamps to 500 flood affected families in order to enable them to live comfortably. HDO often overlook these basic items but with very poor families possessing blankets, mosquito nets and solar lamps is often a luxury and not given priority. With blankets, they will not sleep cold at night, with mosquito nets, they prevent mosquito-borne diseases and with solar lamps, they can do productive work early evenings.</narrative>
  </description>
